Output docs/assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 960
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 10
Set Margin 20
Set MarginFill "#0b1020"

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && alias brixa='node ~/Development/projects/Brixa/dist/cli.js' && rm -rf /tmp/demo && mkdir -p /tmp/demo && cd /tmp/demo && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "brixa"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

